{"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLFrame\/color"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"color","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLColor","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"title":"color","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLFrameV5colorAA8MXLColorVSgvp"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLFrame"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlframe\/color"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"color","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLColor","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLColor":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLColor","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor","title":"MXLColor","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLColor"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The color type indicates the color of an element. Color may be represented as hexadecimal RGB triples, as in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"HTML, or as hexadecimal ARGB tuples, with the A indicating alpha of transparency. An alpha value of 00 is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"totally transparent; FF is totally opaque. If RGB is used, the A value is assumed to be FF.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlcolor"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLFrame/color":{"abstract":[{"text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"color","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"color"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLColor","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLFrame\/color","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlframe\/color","role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLFrame":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlframe","title":"MXLFrame","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The frame type represents a frame or fretboard diagram used together with a chord symbol. The representation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is based on the NIFF guitar grid with additional information. The frame type’s unplayed attribute indicates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what to display above a string that has no associated frame-note element. Typical values are x and the empty"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"string. If the attribute is not present, the display of the unplayed string is application-defined."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLFrame","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLFrame","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLFrame","kind":"identifier"}]}}}